# Unvalidated consolidation — quarantined

This branch retains the failed consolidation attempt for review, not adoption.
The parent commit preserves only pre-existing context needed for the patch; it
is not authored or validated by the consolidation agent. This commit contains
the attributed consolidation edits. Do not merge without review.

`quarantine-manifest.json` records exact before/after hashes and the local backup.
The original main checkout is restored only for these attributed paths.
Scientific code, data, configuration, and unrelated changes are not reverted.
